    {
      "id": "p0144-b007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Although this line did receive extra attention during Undertale's localization, it basically became a literal translation of the English text. Japanese fans do quote it from time to time, but it's not nearly as popular as the original English quote.",
